\title{CorporateDown: Apply a Corporate Design to All 'ggplot2' Figures}
\description{
Define a corporate design once (colours, typography, sizes and logo) as a declarative YAML file and have all subsequent 'ggplot2' figures follow it automatically. A single call to 'set_corporate_design()' registers a matching theme, default colour and fill scales, geom defaults and fonts, so ordinary 'ggplot2' code renders in the corporate design without repeating theme or scale calls. Ships with the design of the Swiss Federal Audit Office (EFK) as a reference.
